I cannot bear to look back on my lost kingdom in the bright moonlight.", "notes": ["This is the opening of Li Yu's famous ci poem, written after he was taken captive when his Southern Tang kingdom fell.", "The speaker is a deposed ruler mourning his lost country."]}

